sequenceDiagram
  participant MX as Remote MX
  participant I as Inbound SMTP
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  MX->>I: SMTP envelope and DATA
  I->>I: Validate bounds and recipient
  I->>DB: Commit mailbox route, raw content, metadata
  alt Commit succeeds
    DB-->>I: Committed
    I-->>MX: 250 accepted
  else Storage failure
    DB-->>I: Failure
    I-->>MX: 451 temporary failure
  else Unknown recipient
    I-->>MX: 550 rejected
  end
